URL: https://ftpmirror.gnu.org/gawk/gawk-5.4.2.tar.gz 3ceb0d840de0500bb8a411db3c0ae6aa219381a0b31aafaee9a968af541249e2
Origname: gawk-5.4.2
Name: gawk

    gawk 5.4.2 with no Fil-C patch: the upstream release tarball ships a ready-made configure and optfil builds it pristine (CC=/opt/fil/bin/filcc ./configure --prefix=/opt/fil).  Replaces the pizlix/gawk-5.4.1.tar.xz copy optfil used to build directly; that pizlix tarball stays for the prelc yolo toolchain stage.
